cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Verification code for: Rationality of the center of a generic division algebra with a group action over a field of characteristic 0"
authors:
  - family-names: Wu
    given-names: Zhengyao
version: 1.0.1
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >-
  Reproduces, by explicit integer linear algebra, the cohomological readings on
  which the main theorem of the accompanying paper rests: h^1(H, I[H]) = C_9,
  h^2(H, M|_H) = C_9, h^2(H, Z) = C_3 x C_3, the h^2 of permutation lattices,
  and the rank of the restricted Procesi lattice (73).  Two independent
  implementations (Python, standard library only; GAP with HAP).
keywords:
  - integral group cohomology
  - Smith normal form
  - Procesi lattice
  - stable permutation
  - rationality
